{"repositoryId":1362645453,"availability":"available","full":"aditya-yadav1176/pigeon","name":"pigeon","description":"Fast, temporary file sharing between devices — no login, no installation, just drop, code, and download.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-09T12:22:31Z","updated":"2026-09-28T11:03:51Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://usepigeon.vercel.app/","topics":["fastapi","file-sharing","python","react","typescript","webapp"],"demo":"https://usepigeon.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:53.273Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:53.273Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T19:33:53.273Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T19:33:53.273Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Temporary file sharing between devices without login, installation, cables, or cloud-drive accounts.","PIGEON is built for quick, frictionless handoffs—especially between phones and laptops. Instead of emailing attachments to yourself or logging into messaging apps on public computers, PIGEON lets you drop a file, generate a 5-character transfer code, and download it on another device.","Moving a PDF, presentation slides, an image, a video, or a text snippet between personal and shared devices (such as lab computers, library workstations, or classroom digital boards) is often annoying. Logging into email, cloud drives, or chat apps on a shared screen leaves accounts exposed, while USB cables and flash drives are rarely on hand."],"features":["Zero Sign-Up: No accounts, passwords, email verification, or phone numbers.","No Installation: Runs entirely inside any standard web browser tab.","5-Character Transfer Codes: Clean alphanumeric codes without confusing characters (0, 1, I, O).","Phone ↔ Laptop Support: Tailored for fast cross-device handoffs.","Multiple File Types: Supports PDFs, PPTX decks, images, MP4 video, and plain t